    "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 432.262993,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "你知道吗？咱们脚下这片土地，几千年来曾经存在过无数个国家，有的在史书里留了名，有的连一个字都没留下，可他们都真真切切的活过。有人说是楼兰，丝绸之路上的明珠，说没就没了。有人说是夜郎夜郎自大，那个夜郎两千年前突然消失。错，真要论起邪乎劲儿，楼兰和夜郎联想前五都进不去。今天咱们就来盘点中国最不可思议的十五个消氏文明分三级讲。今天先讲第十五到第十一，一个比一个神秘。老规矩，开讲之前，麻烦您扣个一越个红心，让我看看都是谁在听第十五名。闽越王国在今天的福建，公元前三百三十四年，越王勾践的西士孙吴江跟楚威王打仗兵败被杀，越国被楚国灭了。越国王族从海陆逃到福建，跟当地的闽人融合，建立了闽越国，成为东南一带最强的势力。公元前一百一十年，芈越国想脱离汉朝版图，汉武帝派大军灭了他，把百姓全部迁到江淮一带。一座王城就这样被烧毁，埋在了武夷山脚下。两千多年后，考古队挖出了城村汉城遗址大型宫殿机制，出土了大量带铭文的文物。一个在史书里只有一千多字的王国，就这样重现人间第十四名。夜郎王国就是夜郎自大。那个夜郎很多人以为夜郎是个笑话，其实不是史记里写的清楚。西南夷军常以神术夜郎最大。汉朝使者出使夜郎的时候，夜郎王问了一句，汉属于我大，这句话传了两千年，变成了成语，可夜郎其实不小。史记说，夜郎有精兵十余万，能拿出十万兵的国家，在当时算得上一方霸主，夜郎国大概存在了三百多年。从战国到西汉成帝年间，夜郎王兴造反，被蔡太守陈立剿灭，夜郎国就此灭亡。可他的族群和文化没有消失，继续在贵州的深山里延续了很长时间。考古队在赫章可勒遗址发现了国内独一无二的套头葬，死者，头部套着铜斧。这种藏俗在全国其他地区从来没发现过第十三名。八国巴人是一个古老的部族，可以追溯到传说里的五帝时代。山海经里就有记载，八人最早活动在汉水流域，后来迁徙到四川东部，跟蜀国打了几百年。公元前三百一十六年，蜀国进攻八国，八国向秦国求救，秦军南下，先灭了蜀国，顺手把八国也灭了巴人，就这样消失在了四川的崇山峻岭中。史书对巴人的记载语言不详，更多的是传说和推测。考古队在涪陵小田溪发现了战国晚期的八国亡陵区，在宣汉罗家坝发现了八人遗址，出土了大批青铜器八人。上午兵甲繁盛，隔剑越一剑比一剑锋利，可巴人到底长什么样，说什么话信什么神，到现在也没人完全搞清楚。第十二名滇国在今天的云南滇池一带，司马迁在史记里写过滇国出现于战国，中期消失于东汉中期，大约存在了五百年。公元前一百零九年，汉武帝发兵灭了滇国，赐了一枚滇王之印，给滇王滇国就销声匿迹了。之后的史料里，几乎再也没有提到过滇国。直到一九五六年，考古学家在滇池东岸的晋宁石寨山发掘出了古滇国墓葬群，出土了那枚滇王之印晶印一亮出来，两千年的谜案一下子对上了。史书上写的滇国地底下挖出来了，古滇国最出名的文物是那些青铜器储备器上著作祭祀的场面，杀人祭住嫖牛，一件比一件震撼。可滇国为什么突然消失到现在？也没个定论。第十一名古虚王国徐国是夏朝就存在的古国，大约公元前两千一百七十年下棋，把博弈的次子若木封在徐地，徐国就此诞生。徐国最强盛的时候，国君徐衍王被周穆王派楚国打败，弃国逃走，投海而死。后来，吴国伐徐水淹徐国都城徐王投奔楚国，徐国从此失去国号，一个存在了一千多年的古国，就这样在春秋乱世里被抹掉了。考古队在江苏邳州一带发现了徐国贵族墓葬，出土了大量青铜器，铭文里频频出现。徐王二字。一个被史书遗忘的王国，靠着青铜器上的铭门，才让后人知道他曾经存在。过从第十五到第十一，闽越国被汉武帝迁走了，百姓夜郎国留下了一个成语和一种奇特的藏俗，八国消失在崇山峻岭里，滇国靠着金印才被重新发现。徐国全靠青铜器上的铭文证明自己存在过，可这五个还只是开胃菜。接下来第十到第六根邪乎，有一个国家，史书上连一个字都没写过，全靠考古队挖出来的青铜器才知道他存在过。有一个国家被灭之后，连二十四师里都没有他的专使，他是谁？他凭什么这么神秘？终极，马上更新。您先点个关注点开头像别走丢。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 810,
      "text": "你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1090,
      "end_ms": 2730,
      "text": "咱们脚下这片土地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3350,
      "end_ms": 6930,
      "text": "几千年来曾经存在过无数个国家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00004",
      "start_ms": 7390,
      "end_ms": 9070,
      "text": "有的在史书里留了名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00005",
      "start_ms": 9430,
      "end_ms": 11170,
      "text": "有的连一个字都没留下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00006",
      "start_ms": 11470,
      "end_ms": 13670,
      "text": "可他们都真真切切的活过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00007",
      "start_ms": 14070,
      "end_ms": 15890,
      "text": "有人说是楼兰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00008",
      "start_ms": 16230,
      "end_ms": 17930,
      "text": "丝绸之路上的明珠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00009",
      "start_ms": 18410,
      "end_ms": 19490,
      "text": "说没就没了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00010",
      "start_ms": 19890,
      "end_ms": 22430,
      "text": "有人说是夜郎夜郎自大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00011",
      "start_ms": 22430,
      "end_ms": 25350,
      "text": "那个夜郎两千年前突然消失。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00012",
      "start_ms": 25890,
      "end_ms": 26130,
      "text": "错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00013",
      "start_ms": 26970,
      "end_ms": 28550,
      "text": "真要论起邪乎劲儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00014",
      "start_ms": 28550,
      "end_ms": 31240,
      "text": "楼兰和夜郎联想前五都进不去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00015",
      "start_ms": 31600,
      "end_ms": 38540,
      "text": "今天咱们就来盘点中国最不可思议的十五个消氏文明分三级讲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00016",
      "start_ms": 38840,
      "end_ms": 41300,
      "text": "今天先讲第十五到第十一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00017",
      "start_ms": 41720,
      "end_ms": 43040,
      "text": "一个比一个神秘。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00018",
      "start_ms": 43820,
      "end_ms": 44540,
      "text": "老规矩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00019",
      "start_ms": 44840,
      "end_ms": 45720,
      "text": "开讲之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00020",
      "start_ms": 46000,
      "end_ms": 48540,
      "text": "麻烦您扣个一越个红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00021",
      "start_ms": 48880,
      "end_ms": 52300,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁在听第十五名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00022",
      "start_ms": 52600,
      "end_ms": 55900,
      "text": "闽越王国在今天的福建，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00023",
      "start_ms": 56180,
      "end_ms": 58000,
      "text": "公元前三百三十四年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00024",
      "start_ms": 58840,
      "end_ms": 64465,
      "text": "越王勾践的西士孙吴江跟楚威王打仗兵败被杀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00025",
      "start_ms": 65240,
      "end_ms": 67055,
      "text": "越国被楚国灭了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00026",
      "start_ms": 67400,
      "end_ms": 70635,
      "text": "越国王族从海陆逃到福建，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00027",
      "start_ms": 70960,
      "end_ms": 73470,
      "text": "跟当地的闽人融合，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00028",
      "start_ms": 73700,
      "end_ms": 75260,
      "text": "建立了闽越国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00029",
      "start_ms": 75540,
      "end_ms": 78220,
      "text": "成为东南一带最强的势力。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00030",
      "start_ms": 78300,
      "end_ms": 79845,
      "text": "公元前一百一十年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00031",
      "start_ms": 80590,
      "end_ms": 83765,
      "text": "芈越国想脱离汉朝版图，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00032",
      "start_ms": 84650,
      "end_ms": 86395,
      "text": "汉武帝派大军灭了他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00033",
      "start_ms": 87080,
      "end_ms": 90015,
      "text": "把百姓全部迁到江淮一带。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00034",
      "start_ms": 90770,
      "end_ms": 93105,
      "text": "一座王城就这样被烧毁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00035",
      "start_ms": 93490,
      "end_ms": 95095,
      "text": "埋在了武夷山脚下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00036",
      "start_ms": 95930,
      "end_ms": 97125,
      "text": "两千多年后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00037",
      "start_ms": 97560,
      "end_ms": 102905,
      "text": "考古队挖出了城村汉城遗址大型宫殿机制，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00038",
      "start_ms": 103820,
      "end_ms": 106455,
      "text": "出土了大量带铭文的文物。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00039",
      "start_ms": 107360,
      "end_ms": 110255,
      "text": "一个在史书里只有一千多字的王国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00040",
      "start_ms": 110700,
      "end_ms": 114435,
      "text": "就这样重现人间第十四名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00041",
      "start_ms": 114780,
      "end_ms": 117560,
      "text": "夜郎王国就是夜郎自大。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00042",
      "start_ms": 117780,
      "end_ms": 120440,
      "text": "那个夜郎很多人以为夜郎是个笑话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00043",
      "start_ms": 120620,
      "end_ms": 123685,
      "text": "其实不是史记里写的清楚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00044",
      "start_ms": 124250,
      "end_ms": 128095,
      "text": "西南夷军常以神术夜郎最大。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00045",
      "start_ms": 128980,
      "end_ms": 131485,
      "text": "汉朝使者出使夜郎的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00046",
      "start_ms": 132360,
      "end_ms": 133705,
      "text": "夜郎王问了一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00047",
      "start_ms": 134220,
      "end_ms": 135535,
      "text": "汉属于我大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00048",
      "start_ms": 135970,
      "end_ms": 137415,
      "text": "这句话传了两千年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00049",
      "start_ms": 137630,
      "end_ms": 138565,
      "text": "变成了成语，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00050",
      "start_ms": 139360,
      "end_ms": 140655,
      "text": "可夜郎其实不小。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00051",
      "start_ms": 141030,
      "end_ms": 141650,
      "text": "史记说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00052",
      "start_ms": 141650,
      "end_ms": 143775,
      "text": "夜郎有精兵十余万，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00053",
      "start_ms": 144590,
      "end_ms": 146585,
      "text": "能拿出十万兵的国家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00054",
      "start_ms": 147010,
      "end_ms": 149395,
      "text": "在当时算得上一方霸主，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00055",
      "start_ms": 149880,
      "end_ms": 152785,
      "text": "夜郎国大概存在了三百多年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00056",
      "start_ms": 153680,
      "end_ms": 156275,
      "text": "从战国到西汉成帝年间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00057",
      "start_ms": 156960,
      "end_ms": 158620,
      "text": "夜郎王兴造反，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00058",
      "start_ms": 158760,
      "end_ms": 161395,
      "text": "被蔡太守陈立剿灭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00059",
      "start_ms": 162350,
      "end_ms": 164250,
      "text": "夜郎国就此灭亡。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00060",
      "start_ms": 164390,
      "end_ms": 166905,
      "text": "可他的族群和文化没有消失，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00061",
      "start_ms": 167610,
      "end_ms": 170825,
      "text": "继续在贵州的深山里延续了很长时间。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00062",
      "start_ms": 172230,
      "end_ms": 178545,
      "text": "考古队在赫章可勒遗址发现了国内独一无二的套头葬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00063",
      "start_ms": 179200,
      "end_ms": 179720,
      "text": "死者，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00064",
      "start_ms": 179720,
      "end_ms": 181035,
      "text": "头部套着铜斧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00065",
      "start_ms": 181460,
      "end_ms": 186015,
      "text": "这种藏俗在全国其他地区从来没发现过第十三名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00066",
      "start_ms": 186460,
      "end_ms": 189695,
      "text": "八国巴人是一个古老的部族，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00067",
      "start_ms": 190330,
      "end_ms": 193405,
      "text": "可以追溯到传说里的五帝时代。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00068",
      "start_ms": 194290,
      "end_ms": 195775,
      "text": "山海经里就有记载，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00069",
      "start_ms": 196570,
      "end_ms": 199495,
      "text": "八人最早活动在汉水流域，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00070",
      "start_ms": 199730,
      "end_ms": 201445,
      "text": "后来迁徙到四川东部，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00071",
      "start_ms": 201700,
      "end_ms": 203275,
      "text": "跟蜀国打了几百年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00072",
      "start_ms": 203840,
      "end_ms": 205665,
      "text": "公元前三百一十六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00073",
      "start_ms": 206340,
      "end_ms": 207915,
      "text": "蜀国进攻八国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00074",
      "start_ms": 208240,
      "end_ms": 209875,
      "text": "八国向秦国求救，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00075",
      "start_ms": 210610,
      "end_ms": 211630,
      "text": "秦军南下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00076",
      "start_ms": 211750,
      "end_ms": 212935,
      "text": "先灭了蜀国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00077",
      "start_ms": 213360,
      "end_ms": 216580,
      "text": "顺手把八国也灭了巴人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00078",
      "start_ms": 216580,
      "end_ms": 219825,
      "text": "就这样消失在了四川的崇山峻岭中。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00079",
      "start_ms": 220390,
      "end_ms": 222965,
      "text": "史书对巴人的记载语言不详，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00080",
      "start_ms": 223460,
      "end_ms": 225405,
      "text": "更多的是传说和推测。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00081",
      "start_ms": 225960,
      "end_ms": 231515,
      "text": "考古队在涪陵小田溪发现了战国晚期的八国亡陵区，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00082",
      "start_ms": 232170,
      "end_ms": 235335,
      "text": "在宣汉罗家坝发现了八人遗址，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00083",
      "start_ms": 236100,
      "end_ms": 238240,
      "text": "出土了大批青铜器八人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00084",
      "start_ms": 238260,
      "end_ms": 239825,
      "text": "上午兵甲繁盛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00085",
      "start_ms": 240220,
      "end_ms": 242465,
      "text": "隔剑越一剑比一剑锋利，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00086",
      "start_ms": 242960,
      "end_ms": 244405,
      "text": "可巴人到底长什么样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00087",
      "start_ms": 244690,
      "end_ms": 246265,
      "text": "说什么话信什么神，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00088",
      "start_ms": 246720,
      "end_ms": 249015,
      "text": "到现在也没人完全搞清楚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00089",
      "start_ms": 249430,
      "end_ms": 253725,
      "text": "第十二名滇国在今天的云南滇池一带，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00090",
      "start_ms": 254200,
      "end_ms": 257790,
      "text": "司马迁在史记里写过滇国出现于战国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00091",
      "start_ms": 257790,
      "end_ms": 260425,
      "text": "中期消失于东汉中期，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00092",
      "start_ms": 260800,
      "end_ms": 262185,
      "text": "大约存在了五百年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00093",
      "start_ms": 262900,
      "end_ms": 264575,
      "text": "公元前一百零九年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00094",
      "start_ms": 264930,
      "end_ms": 267230,
      "text": "汉武帝发兵灭了滇国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00095",
      "start_ms": 267530,
      "end_ms": 269465,
      "text": "赐了一枚滇王之印，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00096",
      "start_ms": 269720,
      "end_ms": 272590,
      "text": "给滇王滇国就销声匿迹了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00097",
      "start_ms": 272670,
      "end_ms": 273610,
      "text": "之后的史料里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00098",
      "start_ms": 273610,
      "end_ms": 275935,
      "text": "几乎再也没有提到过滇国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00099",
      "start_ms": 276570,
      "end_ms": 277935,
      "text": "直到一九五六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00100",
      "start_ms": 278390,
      "end_ms": 285195,
      "text": "考古学家在滇池东岸的晋宁石寨山发掘出了古滇国墓葬群，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00101",
      "start_ms": 285760,
      "end_ms": 289135,
      "text": "出土了那枚滇王之印晶印一亮出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00102",
      "start_ms": 289580,
      "end_ms": 292395,
      "text": "两千年的谜案一下子对上了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00103",
      "start_ms": 292890,
      "end_ms": 296390,
      "text": "史书上写的滇国地底下挖出来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00104",
      "start_ms": 296650,
      "end_ms": 304050,
      "text": "古滇国最出名的文物是那些青铜器储备器上著作祭祀的场面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00105",
      "start_ms": 304850,
      "end_ms": 306510,
      "text": "杀人祭住嫖牛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00106",
      "start_ms": 306830,
      "end_ms": 308290,
      "text": "一件比一件震撼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00107",
      "start_ms": 309070,
      "end_ms": 312370,
      "text": "可滇国为什么突然消失到现在？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00108",
      "start_ms": 312370,
      "end_ms": 313330,
      "text": "也没个定论。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00109",
      "start_ms": 314430,
      "end_ms": 320810,
      "text": "第十一名古虚王国徐国是夏朝就存在的古国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00110",
      "start_ms": 321650,
      "end_ms": 325500,
      "text": "大约公元前两千一百七十年下棋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00111",
      "start_ms": 325760,
      "end_ms": 328980,
      "text": "把博弈的次子若木封在徐地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00112",
      "start_ms": 329360,
      "end_ms": 331300,
      "text": "徐国就此诞生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00113",
      "start_ms": 332200,
      "end_ms": 334120,
      "text": "徐国最强盛的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00114",
      "start_ms": 334760,
      "end_ms": 338480,
      "text": "国君徐衍王被周穆王派楚国打败，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00115",
      "start_ms": 338920,
      "end_ms": 339920,
      "text": "弃国逃走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00116",
      "start_ms": 340380,
      "end_ms": 341300,
      "text": "投海而死。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00117",
      "start_ms": 341780,
      "end_ms": 342260,
      "text": "后来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00118",
      "start_ms": 342380,
      "end_ms": 347700,
      "text": "吴国伐徐水淹徐国都城徐王投奔楚国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00119",
      "start_ms": 348680,
      "end_ms": 351000,
      "text": "徐国从此失去国号，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00120",
      "start_ms": 351460,
      "end_ms": 353945,
      "text": "一个存在了一千多年的古国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00121",
      "start_ms": 354800,
      "end_ms": 358335,
      "text": "就这样在春秋乱世里被抹掉了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00122",
      "start_ms": 358500,
      "end_ms": 362765,
      "text": "考古队在江苏邳州一带发现了徐国贵族墓葬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00123",
      "start_ms": 363530,
      "end_ms": 365375,
      "text": "出土了大量青铜器，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00124",
      "start_ms": 365930,
      "end_ms": 368070,
      "text": "铭文里频频出现。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00125",
      "start_ms": 368270,
      "end_ms": 369515,
      "text": "徐王二字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00126",
      "start_ms": 369940,
      "end_ms": 372645,
      "text": "一个被史书遗忘的王国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00127",
      "start_ms": 373290,
      "end_ms": 375305,
      "text": "靠着青铜器上的铭门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00128",
      "start_ms": 375700,
      "end_ms": 378200,
      "text": "才让后人知道他曾经存在。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00129",
      "start_ms": 378200,
      "end_ms": 380685,
      "text": "过从第十五到第十一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00130",
      "start_ms": 381060,
      "end_ms": 383300,
      "text": "闽越国被汉武帝迁走了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00131",
      "start_ms": 383300,
      "end_ms": 388485,
      "text": "百姓夜郎国留下了一个成语和一种奇特的藏俗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00132",
      "start_ms": 389130,
      "end_ms": 391655,
      "text": "八国消失在崇山峻岭里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00133",
      "start_ms": 392590,
      "end_ms": 395945,
      "text": "滇国靠着金印才被重新发现。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00134",
      "start_ms": 396810,
      "end_ms": 401570,
      "text": "徐国全靠青铜器上的铭文证明自己存在过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00135",
      "start_ms": 401690,
      "end_ms": 404255,
      "text": "可这五个还只是开胃菜。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00136",
      "start_ms": 405230,
      "end_ms": 407155,
      "text": "接下来第十到第六根邪乎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00137",
      "start_ms": 408160,
      "end_ms": 409075,
      "text": "有一个国家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00138",
      "start_ms": 409900,
      "end_ms": 411985,
      "text": "史书上连一个字都没写过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00139",
      "start_ms": 412700,
      "end_ms": 416500,
      "text": "全靠考古队挖出来的青铜器才知道他存在过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00140",
      "start_ms": 416920,
      "end_ms": 419020,
      "text": "有一个国家被灭之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00141",
      "start_ms": 419020,
      "end_ms": 421680,
      "text": "连二十四师里都没有他的专使，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00142",
      "start_ms": 422120,
      "end_ms": 422700,
      "text": "他是谁？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00143",
      "start_ms": 423180,
      "end_ms": 424740,
      "text": "他凭什么这么神秘？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00144",
      "start_ms": 425080,
      "end_ms": 425640,
      "text": "终极，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00145",
      "start_ms": 425900,
      "end_ms": 426880,
      "text": "马上更新。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4ed4d46352185f2f_s00146",
      "start_ms": 427360,
      "end_ms": 432125,
      "text": "您先点个关注点开头像别走丢。"
    }
  ],
